X-WR-CALNAME:Elizabeth line disruption
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-09-27T00:20:00&endDate=2026-09-27T07:00:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nELIZABETH LINE: Sunday 27 September\, between 0120 and 0800\, no service between West Drayton and Maidenhead. Replacement bus service W1 operates between Hayes & Harlington and Slough via Langley (not serving Iver)\, and replacement bus service W3 operates between Slough and Maidenhead via Burnham and Taplow.
DTEND:20260927T070000Z
DTSTART:20260927T002000Z
SUMMARY:Elizabeth line: Part Closure
UID:d0b3f1e8-a149-44ae-afdf-6df9818ad151@d0b3.org
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-09-27T07:00:00&endDate=2026-09-28T00:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nELIZABETH LINE: Sunday 27 September\, from 0800\, a reduced service operates between Paddington and Heathrow Terminal 4 / Maidenhead. Two trains an hour serve Heathrow Terminal 4\, West Drayton\, Langley\, Slough\, Burnham and Maidenhead. Four trains an hour serve Acton Main Line\, West Ealing\, Hanwell and Heathrow Terminals 2 and 3. Six trains an hour serve Ealing Broadway\, Southall and Hayes & Harlington.
DTEND:20260928T002900Z
DTSTART:20260927T070000Z
SUMMARY:Elizabeth line: Reduced Service
UID:2fcb0141-31b6-49ee-98ca-9e9ff973f18b@2fcb.org
END:VEVENT
