DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-09-06T03:30:00&endDate=2026-09-06T06:45:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nELIZABETH LINE: Sunday 6 September\, until 0745\, no service between Paddington and Ealing Broadway.
